{"suttaId":"thag6.2","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1737,1755],"vripara":"381"},"segments":{"thag6.2:0.4":"Tekicchakārittheragāthā","thag6.2:1.1":"“Atihitā vīhi, khalagatā sālī;","thag6.2:1.3":"Na ca labhe piṇḍaṃ, kathamahaṃ kassaṃ.","thag6.2:2.1":"“Buddhamappameyyaṃ anussara pasanno;","thag6.2:2.2":"Pītiyā phuṭasarīro hohisi satatamudaggo.","thag6.2:3.1":"“Dhammamappameyyaṃ anussara pasanno;","thag6.2:3.2":"Pītiyā phuṭasarīro hohisi satatamudaggo.","thag6.2:4.1":"“Saṅghamappameyyaṃ anussara pasanno;","thag6.2:4.2":"Pītiyā phuṭasarīro hohisi satatamudaggo.","thag6.2:5.1":"“Abbhokāse viharasi, sītā hemantikā imā ratyo;","thag6.2:5.3":"Mā sītena pareto vihaññittho, pavisa tvaṃ vihāraṃ phusitaggaḷaṃ.","thag6.2:6.1":"“Phusissaṃ catasso appamaññāyo, tāhi ca sukhito viharissaṃ;","thag6.2:6.3":"Nāhaṃ sītena vihaññissaṃ, aniñjito viharanto”ti.","thag6.2:6.5":"… Tekicchakārī [tekicchakāni (sī. syā. pī.)] thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
